    "content": "Hello Austria. I want to establish good relations early. I have no designs on Trieste - my focus this year is expanding south toward Tunis and the central Mediterranean. Would you be open to a mutual DMZ in Tyrolia and the Adriatic? I won't move to TYR or ADR if you keep TRI coastal and don't push toward Venice. This lets us both focus on more productive expansions - you toward the Balkans, me toward the south. Let me know if this works for you."
