    "message_type": "private",
    "recipient": "RUSSIA",
    "content": "Hello Russia! As Italy, I'm looking to build productive relationships. I notice Austria sits between us geographically - their Balkans expansion could threaten both our interests. I'm planning a Mediterranean-focused opening, but I'd be happy to coordinate pressure on Austria down the line if they get too ambitious. What are your plans for the south? Are you looking at the Black Sea or working with Turkey?"
  },
