The diary intent perfectly aligns with current goals (secure RUM/BOT for expansion to 6 SC/build 2), alliances (high-trust RT for RUM split/BLA/BUL; ENG north for BOT/SWE/NWY; GER DMZ safe with no PRU/SIL/LVN; AUS no BUD-RUM), and aggressive expansion (Ukraine/Serbia/Gal next). All moves to empty provinces: F SEV takes RUM SC (solo, TUR supports via BLA; AUS won't contest). F STP/SC takes BOT (key position vs SWE/NWY, ENG happy/clears NOR). A WAR takes UKR (south staging vs SER/GAL, GER DMZ ok). A MOS to STP/NC (north prep vs SWE/NWY, bounce-free as STP/SC vacates; avoids DMZ violation). No conflicts/bounces expected (AUS VIE-GAL may bounce WAR but UKR safe). All 4 units ordered aggressively (no holds), positions for fall gains (RUM + BOT/UKR staging = 5+ SC trajectory). Primary path to 18 SC: south RT squeeze AUS/TUR, north ENG vs GER/DEN/SWE.

